D[94559]={"^Surrounds the caster with Shadows that have (.-)%% chance of enveloping attackers, inflicting (.-) Shadow damage every (.-) sec for (.-)%.  Stacks%.%s*$","Perto ao conjurador de Sombras que têm {{1}}% de chance denvolver aos atacantes, causando {{2}} de dano de Sombra a cada {{3}} s durante {{4}}. Acumula."}
