D[96603]={"^The Gas Cloud is fixated on the player with Gaseous Bloat%.  If he catches him it will cause him to cast Expunge Gas, inflicting damage to nearby players based on how bloated the player is%.%s*$","Fixa a nuvem de gás sobre o jogador com Inchaço gasosa. Se o alcança, provocará que lance Expurgar gás, que causará dano aos jogadores próximos conforme o inchado que estiver o jogador."}
