D[97956]={"^Reduces the mana cost of all traps, melee abilities and Black Arrow by (.-)%% and reduces the cooldown of all traps and Black Arrow by (.-) sec%.%s*$","Reduz o custo de mana de todas as armadilhas, habilidades corpo a corpo e Flecha negr {{1}}% e reduz a recarga de todas as armadilhas e Flecha Negra {{2}} s."}
